==Battleground==
*20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*2 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~5 seconds<sup>100f~150f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Saber Alter (Enemy)|Saber Alter]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn, delay 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
**3 [[Zigge]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**6 [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

